   "url": "https://theosismedical.com/hacks/nerd-out",
   "title": "Nutritional Nerd Out",
   "kind": "hack",
   "text": "10\nNutritional Nerd Out\nMechanisms. How stuff actually works. Pick a topic — no need to scroll for days. Compulsory if you are me.\nHerein lies a rabbit hole of nutritional and physiologic nerditude. The “why” behind so many things related to our health and how to navigate through it all.\nWhy won’t I shut up about protein? What do I mean by energy? What actually causes type 2 diabetes, and can I reverse it?\nHow do we grow muscle? Don’t care about growing muscle? Why you should care about growing muscle. (No, I’m not saying you have to be jacked and tan.) Muscle serves countless beneficial purposes, and we should at least get it some flowers and let it know we care every once in a while.\nBut seriously, I love this stuff. You don’t have to, but I think you’ll be happy you stuck around by the end of it.\nBuild and repairFuel and energyWhen it goes wrongThe bigger picture\n01\nWhat’s special about protein\n02\nHow do we grow muscle?\n03\nHow fast can you build muscle?\n04\nWhy should we care about muscle growth?\n05\nWhat do we mean by “energy”? Part 1\n06\nWhat do we mean by “energy”? Part 2\n07\nHow does my body decide which fuel?\n08\nYour body has a fat-burning speed limit\n09\nEverything is carbon. You’re carbon. I’m carbon. It’s all carbon.\n10\nHow much you eat matters more than what you eat\n11\nBut it's fake! What are nonnutritive sweeteners exactly?\n12\nWhat actually causes type 2 diabetes\n13\nWhat is hemoglobin A1c?\n14\nHow to reverse type 2 diabetes (for most)\n15\nUnderstanding Cholesterol\n16\nYou are what you eat\n17\nYou are made of stardust\nScrub through Nutritional Nerd Out topics\n01 / 17Next: How do we grow muscle?\n09 Intermittent Fasting Hacks11 Helpful Videos"
